{
  "project": {
    "name": "Timing Belt Clamp",
    "slug": "belt-clamp",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Terminates or tensions a timing belt by gripping its teeth. The gripping face is a comb of ridges cut to the belt's tooth pitch (GT2 = 2 mm, HTD-3M = 3 mm) so the belt's valleys seat into the ridges and cannot pull out. Choose a belt clamp, a slotted tensioner, or a two-ended belt joiner.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Termina o tensa una banda de distribucion sujetando sus dientes. La cara de agarre es un peine de crestas cortado al paso de diente de la banda (GT2 = 2 mm, HTD-3M = 3 mm) para que los valles de la banda se asienten en las crestas y no puedan salirse. Elige una abrazadera, un tensor ranurado o un empalmador de dos extremos.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/belt-clamp.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": ["belt", "timing-belt", "gt2", "htd", "clamp", "tensioner", "cnc", "3d-printer", "robotics", "hyperobject", "commons"],
    "hyperobject": { "is_hyperobject": true },
    "force_backend": true
  },
